      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ab3f8edd4c431c38",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-27B CODER — IQ4_XS 重要性矩阵 · 24 GB 显卡适配 · ~262k 上下文 · MTP 草稿",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bba9ffde89d31af2",
      "translationZh": "经过 LexiPanel 的量化、消融和适配。其 Fit 规划器选择了张量混合以填满一块 24 GB GPU，大约 240k tokens 的上下文。它从代码密集文本构建了重要性矩阵，并将 MTP 头保持在 Q8_0，因此 --spec-type draft-mtp 可以在没有单独草稿模型的情况下工作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2501a21f05d3005",
      "translationZh": "上传者每天为 agentic 编码运行它。在 RX 7900 XTX 上，它在已有 110k–170k tokens 上下文的情况下，解码速度为 36–41 tokens/秒。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e075787dfcc3a817",
      "translationZh": "MTP 头位于 Q8_0，令牌嵌入位于 Q4_K",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0a2383a170a6c990",
      "translationZh": "测量速度（实际使用，非合成基准）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb95dc77e6b04a7c",
      "translationZh": "这些是 2026-10-01 的 agentic 编码会话中的 98 个请求，由服务器自身计时：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "833c55a3627f8aa0",
      "translationZh": "窗口中已有的上下文 请求 解码，中位数 解码，范围",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1926933cb4a1a871",
      "translationZh": "MTP 草稿接受度：中位数是 85%（请求的一半落在 75% 到 94% 之间）。这相当于在草稿深度 2 时大约每解码步骤 2.7 个 token。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1eff54772788a9ba",
      "translationZh": "387 t/s 用于冷 108k-token 提示；",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f1c96cb4f72d0509",
      "translationZh": "175–183 t/s 用于大约 4.5k 新增 token，深度为 147k–156k。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2e068b3f5b947c88",
      "translationZh": "VRAM：在 245,760 token 的上下文中已使用 24.2 GB（共 24.6 GB），带有 q4_1 KV 缓存，且视觉投影器在 CPU 上。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f7072bb8e963548",
      "translationZh": "设置：AMD Radeon RX 7900 XTX（24 GB），llama.cpp b11235 在 Vulkan 后端，所有层在 GPU 上，一个槽位。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5fe50ce391fc00f8",
      "translationZh": "上下文：-c 262144 是在 24 GB 显卡（带 q4_1 KV 缓存）上可放置的权重旁边的值。模型的原生窗口是 262,144 token。在较小的显卡上，先降低 -c。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "32be3bec99ead4a7",
      "translationZh": "推测解码：--spec-type draft-mtp 草稿使用本文件内的 MTP 层，因此不需要单独的草稿模型。需要一个支持 qwen35 架构和 draft-mtp 的最新 llama.cpp；此显卡在 b11235 上进行了测量。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c9c547b7830be156",
      "translationZh": "采样：这些是 Qwen 推荐的设置，并且也存储在文件中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a8dcafe5ee3a0e9b",
      "translationZh": "Agent 循环：主机 RAM 提示缓存有所帮助，例如 --cache-ram 5631 (MiB)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a3b5945a9439dbbd",
      "translationZh": "视觉：此仓库仅保存语言模型。使用 --mmproj mmproj-F16.gguf --no-mmproj-offload 添加 Qwen3.8-27B mmproj。投影器随后在 CPU 上运行，而 VRAM 保持与上下文一起。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "97e7b2a732d010e9",
      "translationZh": "转换：源权重已转换为包含 MTP 头的 BF16 GGUF。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "12e0d8cc5a921127",
      "translationZh": "重要性矩阵：基于约 300k 个 token（570 块）的代码密集校准文本计算得出。四分之三是 Python 源代码（标准库和已安装的包）。其余是技术文档、README 和许可证文本，即编码代理上下文所填充的那类文本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "02fa54e2948331ee",
      "translationZh": "量化：来自 llama.cpp b11182 的 llama-quantize 使用该矩阵生成了 IQ4_XS 文件。MTP 头保持在 Q8_0，以保持其草稿准确，而令牌嵌入为 Q4_K。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "01006b63bb3c1fe9",
      "translationZh": "适配显卡：LexiPanel 的 Fit 规划器为一张 24 GB 显卡在 262144 token 上下文中优先选择质量的混合方案。它选择了该显卡在此上下文下能够承受的最佳质量，而不是最小的文件。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "614932ac71fe3025",
      "translationZh": "量化、重要性矩阵、MTP 草稿设置和显卡适配：LexiPanel。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
